  "change_class": "architecture_corrective",
  "summary": "Connect 10 existing worker health files to the operator BFF with original health contracts. Repair namespace using one dedicated health-only shared named volume (worker-health-data), mounted RW on the 10 worker containers and RO on operator-bff at /data/health, retaining existing HEALTH_FILE env names and unique filenames. Align downstream_health_monitor.py with original lightweight worker/Docker contracts by calling existing validators (services.worker_health, services.background_worker_health, services.evolution.worker_health, services.deployment.outbox_consumer_worker) and original Consultation inline recipe, preserving missing/malformed/stale/failure reporting, functional unready reason extraction, and cadence/safety semantics without duplicate mappings.",
